# Only the ph-job-search skill is tracked in this repo.
# Everything else is local job-search output (applications, resumes,
# cover letters, trackers, archives, OS files) and is ignored.

# Ignore everything
*

# Allow Git to descend into directories
!*/

# Allow this file
!/.gitignore

# Allow only the ph-job-search skill
!/.agents/skills/ph-job-search/
!/.agents/skills/ph-job-search/**
